{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19103460","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19103460","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1910346001:1":{"text":"塔拉萨的族裔们，我的同胞们。你们究竟在做什么？","source_cn":"塔拉萨的族裔们，我的同胞们。你们究竟在做什么？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x2DFCE24CA3018008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910346002:1":{"text":"无论这两个孩子是否选择成为我们的家人，他们都是帮助修复...","source_cn":"无论这两个孩子是否选择成为我们的家人，他们都是帮助修复...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910346003:1":{"text":"可是洄游季——","source_cn":"可是洄游季——","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x5BD4C07BB3BA6911","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910346004:1":{"text":"冷静下来，孩子。你被激荡的洋流冲昏了头脑。","source_cn":"冷静下来，孩子。你被激荡的洋流冲昏了头脑。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xE520784FA1331259","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910346005:1":{"text":"为洄游季准备的养料不足，的确令人忧心。但这不是这两个孩...","source_cn":"为洄游季准备的养料不足，的确令人忧心。但这不是这两个孩...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_tit